{"4240920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HANDSUP", "steam_appid": 4240920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/e579fb041945cbce5d980956d94efd77.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/e579fb041945cbce5d980956d94efd77.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/e579fb041945cbce5d980956d94efd77.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/5039bd1d3f06d91e79bd412327692999.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/5039bd1d3f06d91e79bd412327692999.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/5039bd1d3f06d91e79bd412327692999.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity has no mercy, and neither do your friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hands Up</i>, your bond with teammates is tethered by a <strong>ruthless physics engine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>learn to move as one</strong>, <i>balance your momentum, and trust your friends</i> because in this world, <strong>letting go means starting over</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d38487d597e469c07ad8acb8a94ea979.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d38487d597e469c07ad8acb8a94ea979.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d38487d597e469c07ad8acb8a94ea979.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/f812cacc8f64e67aeecd1955ea9138db.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/f812cacc8f64e67aeecd1955ea9138db.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/f812cacc8f64e67aeecd1955ea9138db.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't just climb, EVOLVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>hidden Rings</strong> scattered across the ascent to <strong>alter your physics</strong> and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>high jump boosts</strong> to <strong>magnetic grips</strong>, you can <strong>customize your playstyle</strong> on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your own unique setup, <strong>guide your friends</strong> with your discoveries, and <strong>rise together</strong>.<br><strong> </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/f95b8069ff24dc7287beab35facf0cd3.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/f95b8069ff24dc7287beab35facf0cd3.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/f95b8069ff24dc7287beab35facf0cd3.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/970d0a7fc6850384cd2f3dccf141b822.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/970d0a7fc6850384cd2f3dccf141b822.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/970d0a7fc6850384cd2f3dccf141b822.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Express yourself without saying a word.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <strong>massive library of hand animations</strong> and <strong>hilarious emotes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to <strong>point out danger</strong>, give a thumbs up, or <strong>taunt a falling friend</strong>, the stage is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your 4 slot emote wheel</strong> to chain reactions instantly. In <i>Hands Up</i>, <strong>style is just as important as survival</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't just parkour, perform.</strong> <br><strong> </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d8edca309c04a9906422c79eadea7a12.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d8edca309c04a9906422c79eadea7a12.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d8edca309c04a9906422c79eadea7a12.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d9395184eec1abfe0a03181c46ab992d.poster.avif?t=1780949469\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d9395184eec1abfe0a03181c46ab992d.webm?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240920/extras/d9395184eec1abfe0a03181c46ab992d.mp4?t=1780949469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Speak to coordinate, whisper to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing <strong>immersive proximity voice chat</strong>, you must work together to ascend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: <strong>the 'Hands' are listening</strong>. <strong>Shout for help</strong> or <strong>scream as you fall</strong> but know that in this echo chamber, <strong>noise gets you hunted</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform with up to 4 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat (Enemies can hear you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Co-op &amp; Single Player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruthless physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic Rings (Hooks, Buffs, and Curses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-Slot Emote Wheel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragr